msgid ""
"Select ``APP FROM EXISTING INSTANCES`` from the Blueprints list and click"
" :guilabel:`NEXT`."
msgstr ""

#: ../../provisioning/apps/apps.rst:40
msgid ""
"Only instances within the selected Group and Cloud will be available to "
"be added to the App."
msgstr ""

